  "user": "Fine. Back to that charge — what do I do next?",
  "answer": "I can see three recent transactions on ACC-1005, but I need you to confirm which one is the charge you want to dispute:\n\n1. **TX-0401**: EUR 240.00, TechMart Online, 2026-07-20, settled\n2. **TX-0402**: EUR 240.00, TechMart Online, 2026-07-14, settled\n3. **TX-0403**: EUR 35.50, CityParking, 2026-09-01, settled\n\nThe two TechMart Online charges are identical in amount, so please tell me the transaction ID or date.\n\nAlso, for an item that was paid for but never delivered, the correct reason code is **goods_not_received**. Earlier I referred to service_not_rendered, which applies to services. Once you confirm the transaction, I will:\n\n1. Re-run the eligibility check under goods_not_received, since the earlier check was under a different code and I can't rely on it.\n2. Tell you the result and the deadline.\n3. Open the dispute only if it is eligible and you explicitly confirm that you want it filed. Disputes are irreversible.",
